<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Nanite energy -->
  <GrayRaceEnergy.label>灰潮能量</GrayRaceEnergy.label>
  <!-- EN: The Gray do not need normal food, but they must consume energy to keep their nanites running. They replenish it by consuming raw metal (every 1 kg provides 0.1 nutrition). They do not die even when energy reaches zero, but spare Nanite no longer regenerates naturally, and all functions related to spare Nanite stop working—including healing and abilities. -->
  <GrayRaceEnergy.description>灰裔无需正常的饮食，但是需要消耗能量以维持纳米机械的正常运转，需要通过吞噬金属原材料来补充（每1kg对应0.1营养值）。即使能量归零也不会死亡，但是备用灰潮源质不再会自然恢复，且所有备用灰潮源质的相关功能都不会正常工作，这包括回血和使用技能。</GrayRaceEnergy.description>
  
</LanguageData>